{"seq":1,"slug":"labeling-annotation","title":"标注与众包","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/data-centric-ai/curation/labeling-annotation","wordCount":1536,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"标注与众包\">标注与众包</h1><p>监督学习的燃料是标签，而标签不会从天上掉下来——它来自人类标注者一个一个打出来的判断。这个过程看似低技术含量，实则是数据为中心 AI 里最容易翻车的环节：一份措辞含糊的标注指南，能让一万个样本同时染上系统性噪声。本篇讲怎么把「让人打标签」做成一门可控的工程，从任务设计、众包组织、一致性度量到程序化弱监督，覆盖标签生产的完整链路。它修复的是 <a href=\"../foundations/data-quality\">数据质量与维度</a> 里的一致性与准确性维度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>标注的本质是把人类的隐性判断转写成机器可消费的显式标签。围绕这个转写过程，有四个关键组件：标注规范（决定标什么、怎么标）、标注者（人力来源）、聚合机制（多人意见如何合一）、质量控制（如何防止与发现坏标签）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>标注模式</th>\n<th>标注者</th>\n<th>成本</th>\n<th>一致性</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>专家标注</td>\n<td>领域专家</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>医疗、法律等高风险</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>众包标注</td>\n<td>平台众包工</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中低</td>\n<td>通用、大规模</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>弱监督</td>\n<td>程序化标注函数</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>取决于函数</td>\n<td>海量、规则可表达</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模型辅助</td>\n<td>模型预标 + 人审</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n<td>半自动加速</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>下图展示原始样本如何经由不同标注模式流向最终的标签集，以及质量控制如何在中途拦截坏标签。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[无标签样本] --&gt; B{选择标注模式}&#10;  B --&gt;|高风险| C[专家标注]&#10;  B --&gt;|大规模| D[众包多人标注]&#10;  B --&gt;|规则可表达| E[弱监督标注函数]&#10;  D --&gt; F[聚合&lt;br/&gt;多数投票/加权]&#10;  E --&gt; G[标签模型去冲突]&#10;  C --&gt; H[质量控制&lt;br/&gt;一致性/抽检]&#10;  F --&gt; H&#10;  G --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt; I[可训练标签集]\">flowchart TD\n  A[无标签样本] --&gt; B{选择标注模式}\n  B --&gt;|高风险| C[专家标注]\n  B --&gt;|大规模| D[众包多人标注]\n  B --&gt;|规则可表达| E[弱监督标注函数]\n  D --&gt; F[聚合&lt;br/&gt;多数投票/加权]\n  E --&gt; G[标签模型去冲突]\n  C --&gt; H[质量控制&lt;br/&gt;一致性/抽检]\n  F --&gt; H\n  G --&gt; H\n  H --&gt; I[可训练标签集]</pre><h2 id=\"标注指南-被低估的杠杆\">标注指南：被低估的杠杆</h2><p>工业标注项目里，准确率提升最大的单一动作往往不是换更贵的标注者，而是把标注指南改清楚。</p>\n<p>指南的核心是消除边界歧义。以「图片里有几个人」为例，部分被遮挡算不算、镜子里的倒影算不算、画里的人算不算——若指南不写，每个标注者会按各自直觉处理，结果就是一致性崩坏。Andrew Ng 反复演示的钢板缺陷案例里，让多位检验员先就「划痕多长才算缺陷」达成统一规范，准确率立刻显著上升。</p>\n<p>一个实用流程是「标注—分歧—修订」迭代：先让多人独立标一小批，找出分歧最大的样本，针对这些样本补充指南规则，再标下一批。分歧样本是指南漏洞的探针。这与 <a href=\"cleaning-debugging\">清洗与数据调试</a> 里用模型置信度找错标的思路互补——一个靠人际分歧定位问题，一个靠模型分歧定位问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"众包与标注者间一致性\">众包与标注者间一致性</h2><p>当标注规模超出专家承载，众包成为必然，随之而来的核心挑战是如何在标注者水平参差时仍得到可靠标签。</p>\n<p>主力工具是标注者间一致性 (inter-annotator agreement, IAA)。两人场景用 Cohen&#39;s Kappa（见 <a href=\"../foundations/data-quality\">数据质量与维度</a>），多人场景用 Fleiss&#39; Kappa。聚合环节最朴素的是多数投票，但它假设所有标注者等可信；更优的是用类似 Dawid-Skene 的概率模型，同时估计每个标注者的可靠度与每个样本的真标签：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∣</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>l</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∝</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><munder><mo>∏</mo><mi>j</mi></munder><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>l</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>∣</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(y_i \\mid \\{l_{ij}\\}) \\propto P(y_i) \\prod_j P(l_{ij} \\mid y_i, \\pi_j)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0197em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">})</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4638em;vertical-align:-1.4138em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∏</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4138em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0197em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>l</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">l_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0197em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是标注者 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 给样本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 的标签，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是该标注者的混淆矩阵。这样能给可靠标注者更高权重，从噪声中恢复出更准的标签。决定「先让众包标哪些样本」以最大化预算收益，则属于 <a href=\"../synthetic/active-learning\">主动学习</a> 的范畴。</p>\n<h2 id=\"程序化弱监督-用代码代替人力\">程序化弱监督：用代码代替人力</h2><p>当样本量大到连众包都嫌贵时，弱监督把标注从「逐条人工」变成「写规则」，是大规模标注的一条捷径。</p>\n<p>弱监督的核心是标注函数 (labeling function)：每个函数是一段启发式代码，对部分样本给出带噪标签（如「文本含『退款』则标为投诉」），其余弃权。多个标注函数会冲突、会重叠、各有不同准确率。Snorkel 这类框架用一个生成式标签模型去估计各函数的可靠度并解决冲突，输出概率化的训练标签，再喂给下游判别模型。</p>\n<p>弱监督的代价是这些程序化标签本身带噪，因此它几乎总要与 <a href=\"cleaning-debugging\">清洗与数据调试</a> 的错标检测配套使用。它与人工标注不是替代关系而是分层：高价值样本上专家标，长尾海量样本上弱监督铺，中间用模型辅助预标加人审。</p>\n<p>程序化弱监督最容易踩的坑，也能用一张表说清。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>反模式</th>\n<th>表现</th>\n<th>后果</th>\n<th>正确做法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>指南先省</td>\n<td>直接开标，靠口头约定</td>\n<td>分歧在数据里沉淀成噪声</td>\n<td>先小批试标暴露歧义再定稿</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多数投票万能</td>\n<td>假设所有标注者等可信</td>\n<td>敷衍者与专家同权，标签变差</td>\n<td>用概率模型估计标注者可靠度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>弱标签直喂</td>\n<td>标注函数产出直接用</td>\n<td>系统偏差被规模放大</td>\n<td>配套错标检测与人工抽检</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话判据：任何一次标注投入后，都该能回答「这一批的标签噪声率是多少、由什么度量得出」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>标注是把人类隐性判断转写成显式标签的工程，核心组件是规范、标注者、聚合机制与质量控制。</li>\n<li>标注指南是被低估的最大杠杆：消除边界歧义、用「标注—分歧—修订」迭代，常比换更贵标注者更有效。</li>\n<li>众包靠标注者间一致性（Cohen&#39;s/Fleiss&#39; Kappa）与概率聚合模型（如 Dawid-Skene）从参差标注中恢复可靠标签。</li>\n<li>程序化弱监督用标注函数 + 标签模型把人力换成代码，适合海量长尾，但产出带噪需配套错标检测。</li>\n<li>本篇修复的是一致性与准确性维度，与下一篇的清洗调试互补——一个靠人际分歧、一个靠模型分歧定位问题。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"标注与众包","id":"标注与众包"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"标注指南：被低估的杠杆","id":"标注指南-被低估的杠杆"},{"level":2,"text":"众包与标注者间一致性","id":"众包与标注者间一致性"},{"level":2,"text":"程序化弱监督：用代码代替人力","id":"程序化弱监督-用代码代替人力"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"数据生命周期","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/data-centric-ai/foundations/data-lifecycle"},"next":{"title":"清洗与数据调试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/data-centric-ai/curation/cleaning-debugging"}}